    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-scĭens</span></b> , entis,
			Part. [scio], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>knowing well.</i>—With <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animum persciens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Commod. 5, 2</span></i>
			.—Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-scĭenter</span></b> , <i>very
				knowingly</i>, <i>very discreetly</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Brut.
				55, 202</span></i>.</div>
